// A transition and its return between two states. Both project onto one point
// of each facing face, and the spread seats them apart. Closer than an em is
// what the score calls crowded, and a search charged for that buys its way out
// with a detour through the far face of each box.
chart roundtrip "there and back" {
  state Ready,
  state Busy,

  trans * -> Ready,
  trans Ready -> Busy "start",
  trans Busy -> Ready "done",
}
